# Project documentation

This repo is **LaTeX to Word** (Git folder `math-to-word`).

Start here:

- `docs/saas/README.md` — index for paid-subscription planning and living docs
- `docs/saas/CURRENT-PRODUCT.md` — the free client-only app as it exists today
- `docs/saas/ARCHITECTURE.md` — planned SaaS: conversion stays in the browser; backend is accounts, billing, entitlements only
- `docs/saas/UI-LAYOUT.md` — intended paid-app layout

Hard constraints unless a file in `docs/saas/DECISIONS.md` overrides them:

- No KaTeX / Temml
- No React/Vue/Svelte for the converter MVP
- Do not upload pasted LaTeX/documents to a server
- Native Word equations via OMML, never images

When you ship a product change, update `docs/saas/CHANGELOG.md` and the relevant SaaS doc in the same change.
